}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After submission, the template appears immediately in the library (count increased from 6 to 7), is visible at the bottom, displays title, author (Test Author), description, category (Other), scenario (Business), usage count (0 uses), and update date (2026-08-24). Template can be selected via Use Template button.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each template card displays all required information: title (Professional Resume), author (Sarah Chen), description, category (Resume), scenario (Business), usage count (1,250 uses), and update date (2024-12-01).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Professional Resume template preview shows properly rendered Markdown: H1 heading \\\"Jane Smith\\\", bold text \\\"Product Manager\\\", H2 headings (\\\"Professional Summary\\\", \\\"Experience\\\", \\\"Education\\\", \\\"Skills\\\"), H3 heading (\\\"Tech Innovations LLC — Senior Product Manager\\\"), separator line, and properly formatted paragraphs with substituted field values.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Filtering by Category (Resume) shows 1 of 7 templates. Filtering by both Category (Resume) and Scenario (Academic) shows 0 of 7 templates. Sorting by \\\"Recently Updated\\\" changes order - Meeting Notes Template (2026-08-24) appears first, followed by Professional Email (2024-12-05), etc. All updates happen without reload and result count updates accordingly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No typo tolerance in search\", \"actual\": \"Searching for \\\"Resumme\\\" (with typo) shows \\\"Showing 0 of 7 templates\\\" and \\\"No templates found\\\". The search does not tolerate small typos or perform fuzzy matching for misspelled keywords.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking the favorite button (heart icon) on Professional Resume adds it to favorites. The Favorites button in header now displays \\\"Favorites 1\\\" showing the count has increased. The favorite button becomes marked as [active], providing visual feedback of the favorited state.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Within favorites-only view showing 1 favorited template (Professional Resume), typing \\\"resume\\\" in search box shows real-time suggestion \\\"Professional Resume\\\" and narrows results to 1 of 7 templates. Filters (Category, Scenario, Sort By) are available and functional within favorites view.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After filling all required fields in Professional Resume and clicking \\\"Copy to Clipboard\\\", a notification appears showing \\\"Copied to clipboard! The generated content has been copied.\\\" The button text changes to \\\"Copied!\\\" and becomes marked [active], providing immediate visual feedback of successful copy action.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-28\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After reloading the page (http://localhost:7089/), the Favorites button still displays \\\"Favorites 1\\\" showing the previously favorited Professional Resume is retained. The custom \\\"Meeting Notes Template\\\" also persists in the library showing 7 of 7 templates including the new custom template.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Email format validation not enforced\", \"actual\": \"Email field accepts invalid format \\\"invalidemail\\\" (without @) and allows preview to display with the invalid value shown as \\\"invalidemail\\\" in the output.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempting to submit a template with all fields empty triggers error notification \\\"Missing required fields - Please fill in all required fields.\\\" Dialog remains open preventing submission. Required fields include title, author, description, content, and at least one defined field.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Special character restrictions not enforced\", \"actual\": \"When filling template fields with text containing special characters (commas, hyphens in dates like \\\"Jan 2015 - Present\\\"), no restriction or neutralization occurs. Text is accepted and displayed as-is in preview without sanitization or error messages.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Professional Resume template shows Preview Result tab is disabled when required fields are empty. After filling all 12 required fields with valid values, the Preview Result tab becomes clickable and preview displays successfully. Preview remains unavailable when required fields are incomplete.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-27\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"When creating custom \\\"Meeting Notes Template\\\", all 4 declared fields (date, attendees, discussion, action_items) had corresponding placeholders in content ({{date}}, {{attendees}}, {{discussion}}, {{action_items}}). System accepted template without errors, confirming field/placeholder mapping validation for valid cases works correctly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-29\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No validation for duplicate field labels\", \"actual\": \"When adding fields to custom template, the UI provides no validation or warning mechanism for duplicate field labels. No evidence of prevention or disambiguation of duplicate labels before template submission.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing \\\"re\\\" (2 characters) shows real-time suggestions including \\\"Professional Resume\\\", \\\"Responsibilities\\\", \\\"Degree\\\", \\\"Weekly Status Report\\\". Clicking \\\"Professional Resume\\\" suggestion fills the search box with \\\"Professional Resume\\\" and narrows results to 1 of 7 templates.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"When typing \\\"re\\\", search results update from 7 to 5 templates without page reload. When category is filtered to \\\"Resume\\\", results show 1 of 7 without reload. When scenario filter is applied, results update to 0 of 7 without reload. Sort changes from \\\"Recently Updated\\\" update order immediately without reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"When Professional Resume template is opened with all fields empty, the UI displays \\\"Required fields missing\\\" with detailed list: \\\"Please fill in: Full Name, Job Title, Email, Professional Summary, Company Name, Position, Start Date, Responsibilities, Degree, School, Graduation Year, Skills\\\". Preview Result tab remains disabled.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-24\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"When favoriting Professional Resume, Favorites button immediately updates from \\\"Favorites\\\" to \\\"Favorites 1\\\", and the favorite button becomes marked [active]. Changes are immediate without reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-25\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Professional Resume template (Markdown template) preview displays all Markdown formatting correctly: headings (h1, h2, h3), bold emphasis, separators, line breaks, and text content properly formatted. Field values are correctly substituted throughout.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-26\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After submitting the custom template, the library immediately displays it without requiring a page reload. Template count updated from 6 to 7 templates in real-time.\"}]}"
